nationally and domestically.</p> </div> </section> <section class="section" data-astro-cid-cgdd2yx3> <div class="container" data-astro-cid-cgdd2yx3> <div class="grid cols-3" data-astro-cid-cgdd2yx3> <article class="card reveal" data-astro-cid-cgdd2yx3> <h3 style="color:var(--brand);" data-astro-cid-cgdd2yx3>Your clients&#39; EB needs in Ireland</h3> <p style="color:var(--muted);margin:0;" data-astro-cid-cgdd2yx3>Our number one priority is to look after your clients&#39; employee-benefit needs in Ireland, on your behalf — with the local knowledge and regulatory standing to do it properly.</p> </article><article class="card reveal" data-astro-cid-cgdd2yx3> <h3 style="color:var(--brand);" data-astro-cid-cgdd2yx3>Global reach when it&#39;s needed</h3> <p style="color:var(--muted);margin:0;" data-astro-cid-cgdd2yx3>When your clients need help in other jurisdictions, we work with our broker partners to service them globally.</p> </article><article class="card reveal" data-astro-cid-cgdd2yx3> <h3 style="color:var(--brand);" data-astro-cid-cgdd2yx3>We work your way</h3> <p style="color:var(--muted);margin:0;" data-astro-cid-cgdd2yx3>We&#39;ll work to your servicing model and your client&#39;s specification — fitting around how you already operate, not the other way round.</p> </article> </div> </div> </section> <section class="section section--navy" data-astro-cid-cgdd2yx3> <div class="container center" data-astro-cid-cgdd2yx3> <h2 class="measure mx-auto" data-astro-cid-cgdd2yx3>Let us support you locally or globally.</h2> <p class="lead mx-auto" style="margin-bottom:2rem;" data-astro-cid-cgdd2yx3>If you have clients with operations or people in Ireland, let's talk about how we can support them on your behalf.</p> <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn--light" data-astro-cid-cgdd2yx3>Start a conversation</a> </div> </section>  </main> <footer class="site-footer section--navy" data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte> <div class="container footer-grid" data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte> <div data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte> <img src="/ebi-logo-stacked-white.png" alt="Employee Benefits Ireland" class="footer-logo" width="800" height="392" data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte> <p class="footer-tag" data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte>
